{
  "name": "dsh-ldvh",
  "version": "2.0.6",
  "description": "LD Vibe Harness（LDVH） 是一个深度绑定 DSH 的 AI 协作与治理框架，核心价值：对齐 Vibe、协调 Coding。\n\n对齐 Vibe：让人与 AI 对项目的由来、现状、去向形成一致的认识。\n协调 Coding：借助宿主调度资源，明晰权责、记录火花、确立规范、构建报告、积累经验、发现摩擦，让项目进展更稳定、执行更顺利。",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ldvh",
    "ld-vibe-harness",
    "governance"
  ],
  "author": "dingminhua",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/dingminhua/dsh-ldvh.git",
    "directory": "plugin"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/dingminhua/dsh-ldvh#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/dingminhua/dsh-ldvh/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.15.0"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./plugin/lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./plugin/lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./plugin/lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./plugin/cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./plugin/cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-atomic-write": "^0.2.2-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths": "^0.2.2-rc.1",
    "compression": "1.8.1",
    "cors": "^2.8.5",
    "dotenv": "^17.2.1",
    "express": "^4.21.2",
    "js-yaml": "^4.1.1",
    "yaml": "^2.8.1"
  }
}
